@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand volley heights
Backhand volley heights, four minutes. Halfway between the front wall and the short line, a metre
off the side wall. Three straight volleys in turn: just above the service line, on it, then just
above the tin. After the low one, let it bounce and start again. Then volley drops, as I call them.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 4:00
0:00 [go]
8% Above the line. On the line. Above the tin.
25% Same punch every time. Only the target changes.
40% Racket high. Firm wrist.
55% Now volley drops. Toss it up high, and volley it short into the front corner on your side.
70% Soft hands. Open face.
85% Want it harder? Make it bounce before the side wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
